Package: kulan-apps
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: libreoffice-writer, libreoffice-calc, libreoffice-impress, libreoffice-gnome, vlc, gimp
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ office and media apps
 LibreOffice for documents, spreadsheets and slides, VLC and GIMP. They
 come with @NAME@ 2.0 and later. Computers installed with an earlier
 version can add them in Kulan Settings › Add-ons.
